{"id":"ebc4b4ba832fc281","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-measure-interval.md","title":"测度确定的实区间","display":"df-measure-interval — 测度确定的实区间","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-measure-interval","aliases":["43-df-measure-interval"],"display":"df-measure-interval — 测度确定的实区间","depends_on":["[[43-df-cylinder]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§9.9.2 Definition 9.9.2，印刷198，PDF218","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false,"local_proof_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-measure-interval"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-measure-interval</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-measure-interval — 测度确定的实区间"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§9.9.2 Definition 9.9.2，印刷198，PDF218"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 的Borel概率测度，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\sigma]\">\\([\\sigma]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(i)\">\\(\\sigma(i)\\)</span> 为有限串第i位，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\sigma|\">\\(|\\sigma|\\)</span> 为其长度。以下定义关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}\">\\(&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}\\)</span> 以及函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"l_\\nu,r_\\nu:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to[0,1]\">\\(l_\\nu,r_\\nu:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to[0,1]\\)</span>、区间族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_\\nu\">\\(I_\\nu\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}\\sigma\\iff |\\tau|=|\\sigma|\\land\\exists i\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(i&lt;|\\sigma|\\land(i,0)\\in\\tau\\land(i,1)\\in\\sigma\\land\\forall j\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall b\\in\\{0,1\\}\\;\\left(j&lt;i\\Rightarrow((j,b)\\in\\tau\\iff(j,b)\\in\\sigma)\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}\\sigma\\iff |\\tau|=|\\sigma|\\land\\exists i\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(i&lt;|\\sigma|\\land(i,0)\\in\\tau\\land(i,1)\\in\\sigma\\land\\forall j\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall b\\in\\{0,1\\}\\;\\left(j&lt;i\\Rightarrow((j,b)\\in\\tau\\iff(j,b)\\in\\sigma)\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"l_\\nu(\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\substack{\\tau\\in2^{|\\sigma|}\\\\\\tau&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}\\sigma}}\\nu([\\tau]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[l_\\nu(\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\substack{\\tau\\in2^{|\\sigma|}\\\\\\tau&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}\\sigma}}\\nu([\\tau]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"r_\\nu(\\sigma)\\coloneqq l_\\nu(\\sigma)+\\nu([\\sigma]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[r_\\nu(\\sigma)\\coloneqq l_\\nu(\\sigma)+\\nu([\\sigma]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I_\\nu(\\sigma)\\coloneqq[l_\\nu(\\sigma),r_\\nu(\\sigma)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I_\\nu(\\sigma)\\coloneqq[l_\\nu(\\sigma),r_\\nu(\\sigma)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每一层有限个区间按字典序相邻，其长度为ν([σ])；相邻区间可能共享端点，零测柱集对应退化区间。空串对应[0,1]。有限求和给出唯一的lν、rν和闭区间，无代表元选择问题。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.9.2 Definition 9.9.2，印刷198，PDF218。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地推广或推论已单独注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\nu$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 的Borel概率测度，$\\sigma,\\tau\\in2^{<\\omega}$，$[\\sigma]$ 见 [[43-df-cylinder]]。$\\sigma(i)$ 为有限串第i位，$|\\sigma|$ 为其长度。以下定义关系 $<_{\\mathrm{lex}}$ 以及函数 $l_\\nu,r_\\nu:2^{<\\omega}\\to[0,1]$、区间族 $I_\\nu$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma,\\tau\\in2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma(i)","display":false},{"tex":"|\\sigma|","display":false},{"tex":"<_{\\mathrm{lex}}","display":false},{"tex":"l_\\nu,r_\\nu:2^{<\\omega}\\to[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"I_\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau<_{\\mathrm{lex}}\\sigma\\iff |\\tau|=|\\sigma|\\land\\exists i\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(i<|\\sigma|\\land(i,0)\\in\\tau\\land(i,1)\\in\\sigma\\land\\forall j\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall b\\in\\{0,1\\}\\;\\left(j<i\\Rightarrow((j,b)\\in\\tau\\iff(j,b)\\in\\sigma)\\right)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"l_\\nu(\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\substack{\\tau\\in2^{|\\sigma|}\\\\\\tau<_{\\mathrm{lex}}\\sigma}}\\nu([\\tau]).","display":true},{"tex":"r_\\nu(\\sigma)\\coloneqq l_\\nu(\\sigma)+\\nu([\\sigma]).","display":true},{"tex":"I_\\nu(\\sigma)\\coloneqq[l_\\nu(\\sigma),r_\\nu(\\sigma)].","display":true}],"bytes":1727,"backlinks":[{"id":"47c9273664941e32","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\nu$ 是Cantor空间Borel概率测度，$I_\\nu$ 见 [[43-df-measure-interval]]，$\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)$ 见 [[43-df-measure-atoms]]。以下以图定义 $\\operatorname{real}_\\nu$ 与 $\\operatorname{seq}_\\nu$，其定义域分别为 $E_\\nu\\subseteq2^\\omega$ 与 $D_\\nu\\subseteq[0,1]$；$\\exists!$ 为唯一存在量词。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-247","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-measure-interval]] — 测度确定的实区间"}],"outgoing":["ab1ef7b1cac112c1"]}